# Build artifacts only. Cargo.lock is deliberately RE-INCLUDED (the same rule
# as ../latency/native/.gitignore): the repo root .gitignore ignores every
# non-root Cargo.lock, but this isolated workspace's lockfile pins the exact
# flatbuffers, prost, capnp and criterion releases the vendored generated code
# and the published method were built with.
/target/
!Cargo.lock
